<title>GERMANY: Metallgesellschaft says hits 95/96 target.</title>
<headline>Metallgesellschaft says hits 95/96 target.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German metals and trading group Metallgesellschaft AG said on Friday pre-tax profit in the 1995/96 financial year leaped 70 percent to over 290 million marks.</p>
<p>&quot;This means the company has managed to achieve the demanding target set out last year despite a deterioration in the economic conditions,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 16 billion marks from the previous 17.6 billion as a result of the planned reduction in its trading activities. Staff levels were largely unchanged at around 23,300 employees.</p>
<p>Full details of the figures are due to be published around midday, it added.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
